  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Luang Prabang Adm. Reform - Sida appraisal of ph II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Luang Prabang Adm. Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r ett pilotprojekt p&#xe5; provinsniv&#xe5; inom ramen f&#xf6;r  Governance and Public Admininstration Reform och avser att st&#xe4;rka den lokala f&#xf6;rvalningen p&#xe5; provins-, distrikt- och by-niv&#xe5;. Projektet omfattar 8 pilotkontor, utbildningsinsatser inom  ekonomiadministration, f&#xf6;rvaltning (planering och budgetering) och r&#xe4;ttsliga fr&#xe5;gor. Projektet genomf&#xf6;rs tillsammans med UNDP. 11,7 mkr</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a pilot decentralisation project in Luang Prabang Province and part of Governance and Public Administration Reform. The purpose is to strengthen the administrative capacity at province, district and village level in terms of financial, planning and budgeting and legal matters. It includes 8 pilot offices at province and district level. Cooperating partners are UNDP and the Gov Office.</narrative>
  </description>
